{
  "sourceId": "post-corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid-zh-TW",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵如果你發現你的筆記型電腦在某個區域有 WiFi 連線，但在某些 WiFi 訊號滿格的區域失去連線，你可能連接到了故障的 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辦公室中有許多路由器共享相同的 SSID，以便你的筆記型電腦決定連接到最佳的 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，有些可能會隨著時間而故障。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你連接到附近的故障 WiFi 路由器，允許你連接但沒有適當的網際網路連線，以下步驟可能會有所幫助。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "首先，使用以下命令檢查你連接到哪個 WiFi 路由器：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show interface</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "查看 SSID 下的 BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID 是一個可以代表多個 WiFi 路由器的 ID，但 BSSID 是特定 WiFi 路由器的唯一 ID：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>There is 1 interface on the system:",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Name : Wireless Network Connection↵ Description : Intel(R) Centrino(R) Advanced-N 6205↵ GUID : d827d652-b7f5-412e-xxxx-1235ea895d99↵ Physical address : aa:aa:aa:aa:aa:aa↵ State : connected↵ SSID : ABC↵ BSSID : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Cipher : CCMP↵ Connection mode : Auto Connect↵ Channel : 1↵ Receive rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Transmit rate (Mbps) : 144↵ Signal : 99%↵ Profile : ABC",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hosted network status : Not started↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "筆記型電腦透過路由器 zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz 連接到 WiFi 網路 ABC。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 SSID ABC 下還有其他可用的路由器嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>$ netsh wlan show all</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從結果中尋找 SHOW NETWORK MODE=BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它顯示 WiFi 網路 ABC 可用的所有路由器：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<pre>=======================================================================↵======================= SHOW NETWORKS MODE=BSSID ======================↵=======================================================================",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID 8 : ABC↵ Network type : Infrastructure↵ Authentication : WPA2-Personal↵ Encryption : CCMP↵ BSSID 1 : xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx↵ Signal : 80%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 40↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 2 : yy:yy:yy:yy:yy:yy↵ Signal : 76%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 161↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6 12 24↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 9 18 36 48 54↵ BSSID 3 : zz:zz:zz:zz:zz:zz↵ Signal : 99%↵ Radio type : 802.11n↵ Channel : 11↵ Basic rates (Mbps) : 6.5 16 19.5 117↵ Other rates (Mbps) : 18 19.5 24 36 39 48 54 156↵</pre>",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SSID ABC 下有 3 個 BSSID，這意味著當你嘗試連接到名為 ABC 的 WiFi 網路時，範圍內有 3 個 WiFi 路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "預設情況下，使用訊號最強的 WiFi 路由器，因為它可以提供最佳的連線和傳輸速度。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，在這種情況下，訊號最強的路由器沒有正確配置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們如何強制筆記型電腦連接到正常運作的路由器，即使訊號較弱？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "假設我們想連接到 BSSID 為 xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx 的路由器。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "* *",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 Windows 中，我們可以進入控制台並管理你的 WiFi 設定。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "右鍵點擊你想連接的 WiFi 網路，然後選擇內容。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在無線網路內容中，勾選_啟用 Intel 連線設定_，然後點擊設定。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "選擇_強制存取點_，輸入你想連接的 BSSID。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "點擊確定以儲存設定。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由於訊號強度差導致連線不佳，速度可能會較慢，但至少你可以生存下來，直到有人修復問題。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "上述選項僅適用於 Intel WiFi 介面卡。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不知道其他 WiFi 驅動程式是否提供強制 BSSID 的功能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在其他 WiFi 驅動程式中找到它，請告訴我。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid",
        "title": "企業網路生存指南 - 如何連接到具有相同 SSID 的另一個 WiFi 路由器",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/corporate-network-survival-guide-how-to-connect-with-another-wifi-router-with-the-same-ssid/"
      }
    }
  ],
